{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:19:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_36701d1b1617474ab7bf24222ca63999","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_afa90ea1e619ea00dfc7f85d72dedeeca0d260a1ea753a50bea910bab7f17397","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"sanbuphy/learn-coding-agent@ce8ca4a8e722 snapshot e96abc602fa9c456","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3b09c6191d512b1750d80949c5d5332b74f22f2b66f17396e7b0832af3ecfa72","slc_cebdb165ac53dd1e1672747c0b0c742a70d011be6ae8120882919d09f8f35748","slc_f3972a46d9153f62a1c9531befeed7347a9748766bc736cb4762483e32ce628f"],"source_ids":["src_0fbc4da58276514eb45254c9997a644b"],"text":"The telemetry report states first-party event logging cannot be disabled by direct Anthropic API users, with no user-facing setting to turn it off, and that OTEL_LOG_TOOL_DETAILS=1 enables full tool input logging.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:19:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_36701d1b1617474ab7bf24222ca63999"}
